/v1/","context":{"app_id":2949960,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2949960","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:33:48Z","value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3369460","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2949960-1847286114036391","game_id":"steam-2949960","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update (Oct 23, 2026): Fix for a game-breaking bug","summary":"Thank you for playing! We've updated the demo. This update focuses on fixing a bug that could leave you stuck. We're sorry to everyone who ran into it.▶ Get the demo here: Re:Connect Demo on Steam🚨 Game-Breaking Bug FixFixed: the screen stayed black after dying in a puzzleSymptomsIf you died in a puzzle while holding a button that isn't used during play, the screen could fade to black and never come back, leaving you unable to do anything.This mainly happened when dying while holding the ■ butto","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:21:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036391","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:06:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2949960-1847286114027424","game_id":"steam-2949960","kind":"update","title":"Devlog #4: \"Too easy,\" \"too short\"... so here's a BIG demo update!","summary":"Hi, I'm Mapyon, the developer of Re:Connect. For Steam Next Fest, which is running right now, we've given the demo a big update to Ver.1.5. ▲ In the LivingArea, everyday electronics around you become puzzles. Two things you told us about the May demoOur May demo got a \"Positive\" rating on Steam, but two comments kept coming up: \"the puzzles are too easy\" and \"there isn't enough to play.\" This update is our answer to both. On to Chapter 2, with more than 3x the puzzlesYou can now play partway int","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T03:28:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027424","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:06:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2949960-1846651706692977","game_id":"steam-2949960","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Ver.1.5: Chapter 2 \"LivingArea\" added & 3x more puzzles","summary":"Thank you for playing Re:Connect! We've updated the demo to Ver.1.5 for Steam Next Fest October 2026. Based on your feedback on the May demo — \"the puzzles are too easy\" and \"there isn't enough content\" — this update adds Chapter 2, along with quality-of-life improvements and bug fixes. New features Chapter 2 \"LivingArea\" is now playable After the Chapter 1 ending, choose \"Continue to Chapter 2\" to carry on with your save data. You can also start Chapter 2 from the beginning with \"From Chapter 2","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:44:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692977","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2949960-1844751498227312","game_id":"steam-2949960","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Ver.1.2.2","summary":"We've updated the Re:Connect demo! Thank you for playing. This update mainly fixes issues that could block your progress, along with a few adjustments. Progression Fixes Fixed an issue where the goal would not appear after defeating the Maid Boss if you were standing on the tile where it spawns, leaving the player unable to move. Fixed an issue where, after returning to the title screen during a conversation or event and starting a New Game, the player could spawn in the wrong position in the fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T14:13:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227312","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2949960-1844751498227066","game_id":"steam-2949960","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2: Our Tokyo Game Show 2026 report","summary":"Hi, I'm Mapyon, the developer of Re:Connect. We've wrapped up five days at SELECTED INDIE 80, Tokyo Game Show 2026. Thank you so much to everyone who stopped by our booth! Five days at our own boothLast year we showed Re:Connect in a corner of the iGi incubator booth. This year we had a booth of our own, in a busy spot that nobody could miss, with four demo stations, the most we could fit. We handed out 2,000 uchiwa fans and nearly 300 exclusive postcards. What players told us\"The biggest surpri","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T11:55:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227066","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2949960-1843481262695293","game_id":"steam-2949960","kind":"announcement","title":"“Re:Connect” Has Been Selected for TGS 2026's “SELECTED INDIE 80”","summary":"Hi, I'm Mapyon, the developer of Re:Connect at Studio Wink. Starting this week, I'll be posting a devlog here every week. First, some news: Re:Connect has been selected for SELECTED INDIE 80 at Tokyo Game Show 2026. You can play it at Makuhari Messe, Japan, from September 17 to 21! What is Re:Connect?If emotions can be programmed, can we call that a heart? Re:Connect is a programming puzzle adventure where you connect cords to change the rules. You play as a newborn Debug AI: push and pull units","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T13:33:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695293","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2949960-1833968530889972","game_id":"steam-2949960","kind":"announcement","title":"『Re:Connect』 Demo Availability Ending on May 31, 2026","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the 『Re:Connect』 demo!We’re happy to announce that the Steam demo has reached 10 reviews and earned a “Positive” rating. All of your feedback and comments have been incredibly encouraging for our development team.The currently available Steam demo of 『Re:Connect』 will remain available until May 31, 2026.Based on the feedback we received from this demo, we plan to continue polishing and improving the game.Before the full release, we also plan to publish an upd","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T03:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530889972","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2949960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2949960":"2026-10-26T00:21:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2949960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"3369460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2949960","app_id":2949960,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:10Z","source_url":"ht